  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing the impact of digital narratives &amp; behaviours on conflict</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to identify and mitigate harmful digital behaviours that influence conflict dynamics. By drafting best practices, reviewing FCDO frameworks and conducting interviews the project seeks to understand and address the impact of digital hate speech, misinformation, and influence operations.</narrative>
  </description>
